From: jonathansong <7958352+jonathansong@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] [Flow] Add a pass that generalizes executables differing only in constants

The local-tree version (IREE e4a3b04) of compiler/patches/iree-pr3 (the
upstream PR against main): pass iree-flow-generalize-executables, pipeline
flag --iree-flow-enable-executable-generalization (off by default), lit test
test/generalize_executables.mlir.

